{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "789e0fdb9d761b1a25274b471c088c867918ae4abb36c0ef1bcd56a74d61db2a", "ja": "なんとなくできちゃった", "zh": "不知不觉就做好了", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "624dd4750eeb21f484a867846b612e197eb250f5cacf3e2bb766ed904b6eecc0", "ja": "天体公演のレッスンが始まった。麗花はなぜ\nか、せつない歌を完ぺきに歌いこなす。これ\nにはプロデューサーもビックリ。紗代子とジ\nュリアは、自分達も負けていられないと気合\nいを入れ直すのだった。", "zh": "天体公演的课程开始了。丽花不知为何，\n竟能完美地唱出伤感的歌曲。这让制作人\n也大吃一惊。纱代子和朱莉娅也重新振作\n精神，暗自鼓劲，觉得自己不能输给她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a407af3730684c50d38f1f68d029291417f9a8bbecfe96535d59985c28d7b1e3", "ja": "（天体公演に向けて、アクアリウスはレッスン中だ！\n歌詞もできてきて、今日は歌合せなんだけど……）", "zh": "（为了天体公演，水瓶座正在进行练习！歌词也逐渐成形了，今天要对歌，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "5549670294cdac7b8f1fa78a97bdaee3827af1c6f67a71ba2e8d6ded5a953d2c", "ja": "ふぅ～……あー、楽しかった～♪\nやっぱり、一緒に歌うと楽しいね！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "呼～……啊，真开心～♪\n果然，大家一起唱歌就是开心呢！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "47c71e4e545c9618a5c358747d1f0f262a8d36fae5799b49eaacad981eca946e", "ja": "あれあれ？　みんな、どうしたの？\nあっ、わかった！　だ～るまさんが～……♪", "zh": "咦咦？大家这是怎么了？\n啊，我知道了！一二三——木头人～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "7e5f34c793ccd2a2d610e85b4e1e7e81d4baf82b675c7a16cc5463f743c8e109", "ja": "麗花さん、違います！\nだるまさんが転んだをしているんじゃなくて……！", "zh": "丽花小姐，不对！\n我们不是在玩“一二三，木头人”……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "6d85f87411e64c8be431c2e86b38e2ab3c4886f09472ce29a320b58bb10c61f8", "ja": "レイ、ウチらは驚いてるんだ。\n今の歌、メチャクチャよかった……いや。", "zh": "丽，我们可是被惊到了。刚才那首歌，真的好得不得了……不对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "a60915da63601be5554f7afe24f6f1ab5d54a26719b427483856b5c19b7a0c4b", "ja": "心に響いたよ。\n聴いてて苦しくなるくらい、せつなかった。", "zh": "打动我了。\n听得我心里发紧，太让人心碎了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "38e05e0c0ec4c3c1e57eab43ab3295b56b1255113cdf920906491285b7e201cf", "ja": "そうだな、ここまでモノにしてくるなんて。\n麗花、いったいどうしたんだ？", "zh": "是啊，居然能把这首歌演绎到这种程度。丽花，你到底是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "f86a19c4bc27a4664a9e65f6b918893657927ecbb98dd68dbe4e3d2433e1338b", "ja": "えっ？　うーん……よくわかりませんけど、\nほめてもらえて嬉しいです。えっへん♪", "zh": "诶？嗯……虽然我也不太明白，但能得到夸奖还是很开心的。哼哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "2bffe6679bcd6449e50f059124581ac30512dde0bf0b0b4ad5fe1a4a0018243b", "ja": "わからないのに、あんなに歌えちゃうんだ……。\nやっぱり、麗花さん凄いなぁ。", "zh": "明明不太明白，却能唱成那样啊……\n丽花小姐果然好厉害啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "2ceec430f5540a420c11e20b0114333b668815c3cc18261bd493e2b07fb4955e", "ja": "やれやれ、あたしはもっと歌い込まないとな。\nまだ全然、自分の歌にできてない。", "zh": "哎呀哎呀，我得多练唱才行啊。\n还完全没有把它变成属于自己的歌呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "2ddfe58c661cea3b7db8d3c9edf2b6ed13492a1a51d8adcfca41e1159d77652b", "ja": "私も、まだメロディを覚えただけ……。\nよーしっ！　私も負けないように、気合いっ！", "zh": "我也还只是记住了旋律而已……好——！我也不能输，打起精神！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "ca073fbdb25b0530d9459e0a502341d9337c4b85631cf3aebb3b8f8622166e07", "ja": "あの、麗花さん、教えてください！\nなにか気をつけてることとか、ありますか？", "zh": "那个，丽花小姐，请教教我吧！\n有什么需要特别注意的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "17ad5577dde9cd6116263a257de73120d4876bfab5c475e4ebceb4eca2ba7174", "ja": "そうだよレイ、\nもしかして、歌い方のコツでもあるのか？", "zh": "没错，丽——\n难道你有什么唱歌的诀窍吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "25d1922e1ac23dd7941989d7db1fdcfba9a36e869814bbacc87e01e8bd7b129b", "ja": "コツ？　うーん、そうだなぁ。\n最初はぽわーっていって、サビはスワッ！って。", "zh": "诀窍？嗯——该怎么说呢。一开始要唱得轻飘飘的，然后到了副歌就“唰”地一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "05bf60d425bf1f6cfb5273ea9e82600b5fec51c2200609d079a6022ce9b19ae1", "ja": "ぽわーっていって、スワッ……。\nなるほど、そういうコトか。あはは～……", "zh": "先说“噗哇——”，然后“唰……”。\n原来是这么回事啊。啊哈哈～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "980c3562220e652ade2bdfc61cdee2fac9bd18ab55970e1f5f44efe7f947cea3", "ja": "って全然わかんないって！\nサヨ、わかるか！？", "zh": "我完全听不懂啊！\n纱代，你明白吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "f166d6d99647ea745b07c696b26c7be16e8764dfb8a22cd1eade469b391130a4", "ja": "え、えっと……とにかく、マネしてみようよ！\n最初はぽわーっと、ぽわーっと……！", "zh": "呃、那个……总之，先试着模仿一下吧！一开始要轻飘飘的，轻飘飘的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "a0d1fc8614a6b1000b6e9c2543c1ba97b431f3ed908c5af54b434b3691706b70", "ja": "ぽわぽ～わ、ぽわぽ～わ、ぽわぽ～わ、ぽ～わ……\nぽわぽ～わぽ～わ、ぽ～わ、ぽ～わぽ～わ、ぽわ……", "zh": "噗哇噗～哇、噗哇噗～哇、噗哇噗～哇、噗～哇……\n噗哇噗～哇噗～哇、噗～哇、噗～哇噗～哇、噗哇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "a3da6213a530642cc6776626f9cd7d98be9e1da17778e1353a3d01a2c44439ab", "ja": "ぽわぽ～わ、ぽわぽ～わ、ぽわぽ～わ、ぽ～わ……\nぽわぽ～わぽ～わ、ぽ～わ、ぽわぽ～わ、ぽ～わ……", "zh": "啵哇～哇、啵哇～哇、啵哇～哇、啵～哇……\n啵哇～哇啵～哇、啵～哇、啵哇～哇、啵～哇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "f2326e723fd345de8e0a2916521cd6802d5a75bd4952f257b305190d32fb50ee", "ja": "ちっがーーーう！！", "zh": "不对——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "5fad30521058f9ffd391bd097aaf595ae1c11bf30d7d3d7da2632621dd0e157f", "ja": "ちがう～～～！！", "zh": "不对～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "b75e6f3cbba631647ae19d26d258d283d73d9861fe72b4837e032aec4f4ca947", "ja": "……うーん？", "zh": "……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1025_p", "source_sha256": "541dc30b3ba9b8139e027ced2044beafa50d217b9610167d5d21c9ce835ffef3", "ja": "まあ、そういうことじゃないよな……。", "zh": "嗯，也不是这么回事吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "586b910bb6199f92375f0077a858c926730059c8fcaf0f57e285ee2a30f09989", "ja": "うん、ヤメよう。レイのマネはできない。\n……つーか、マネにもなってないよな、きっと。", "zh": "嗯，还是放弃吧。学不来玲音那一套。\n……或者说，肯定连模仿都算不上吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1027_027say", "source_sha256": "f0bb115d3fec17de7812174906039aa96385e9effdff13c8ba775fdf41dcb118", "ja": "そうだよね……。ジュリア、私たちは、\n自分なりの表現を探さなくちゃ！", "zh": "就是这样……茱莉亚，我们必须寻找属于自己的表达方式！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "cacae8bc2fcf2c145cabb93298513112a507bb4a91af669fc9018994232a4935", "ja": "うんうん、その方がいいよねっ。私がそんなに\nうまく歌えたって、あんまり思わないし……。", "zh": "嗯嗯，那样比较好呢。我也不觉得自己能唱得那么好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1029_048rei", "source_sha256": "a02fbfd53d2c899a1bc4412132741a860e464a6d4ca5f7767b460d9ac7c9d32c", "ja": "それに、せっかく3人でユニットなんだもん。\n3人それぞれの歌い方で、一緒に歌いたいな♪", "zh": "而且，难得我们是由3人组成的组合嘛。想让3人各自用自己的唱法，一起唱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1030_027say", "source_sha256": "d73cf141eb5b6dfd2e8e09c80571d008a016c572e460a43a8bf76a94f3a3ea74", "ja": "麗花さん……。", "zh": "丽花小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "7c1c552bea7aeb3db45e5af4b387263aeb6356466bdf106eb53898efb47cb90b", "ja": "レイ……。", "zh": "丽……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "701554c43136a97f7f157c0659fcedf77b6b9eecba9cc8ccb1640a00d34eedef", "ja": "そうだな、まだ時間もあるし。\nアクアリウスならではのハーモニー、探していこう！", "zh": "是啊，时间还很充裕。\n那就一起寻找只有水瓶座才能演奏出的和声吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1033_048rei", "source_sha256": "d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c", "ja": "はーい♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1034_027say", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "32eb1aae8fecc44685cad2aacec47d1c9306b9b15b446a23257a075067be5720", "ja": "おうっ！", "zh": "哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1036_050jul", "source_sha256": "b73cfb10fad616b8d5e5dd0854c3ca1264924d68322503df3fd377b451de6855", "ja": "よしっ、そうと決まれば、レッスン再開だ！\nサヨ、もっかい合わせてみようぜ。", "zh": "好，既然决定了，那就重新开始练习吧！\n纱代子，再来合一次吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1037_027say", "source_sha256": "1e856a59fc300e2a36ebf72befdab8329c3558f162baf98c0739da2d510ff1e7", "ja": "うん！　麗花さん、また聞いてもらっても\nいいですか？　あとで感想ききたいです！", "zh": "嗯！丽花姐，能再听我唱一遍吗？之后想听听你的感想！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1038_048rei", "source_sha256": "3c222369ede3c8ef239a613fc0d05e6fdc4f04334d8c6da44074978ed10173a5", "ja": "おっけー♪　でも、私も歌っちゃったらゴメンね！\nふんふふんふふーん♪", "zh": "好呀♪不过，要是我也忍不住唱起来了，可别怪我哦！\n哼哼哼哼哼～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_02_1039_p", "source_sha256": "8b826e4ddce793d80f1e4300daeb8e848325b0504b1009b7efd01b4352002678", "ja": "（麗花には驚かされたけど、ジュリアも紗代子も\n前向きだ。3人ならではの歌を楽しみにしていよう！）", "zh": "（虽然丽花让我大吃一惊，不过茱莉亚和纱代子也都很积极。\n就期待只有3人才唱得出的歌曲吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
